Package: landisR.bda
Type: Package
Title: Base Biological Disturbance Agents for landisR
Version: 0.0.0.9013
Authors@R: person("Yan", "Boulanger", email = "yan.boulanger@nrcan.gc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements outbreaks and spatial dispersal for one or more agents from the
    LANDIS-II 4.0.1 Base Biological Disturbance Agent extension. It evaluates
    resources and cohort mortality directly against the shared forest state
    and participates in the LANDIS-II version 7 random stream.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: landisR (>= 0.1.0.9015), Rcpp
LinkingTo: landisR (>= 0.1.0.9015), Rcpp
NeedsCompilation: yes
